  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_npc_key_01",
      "hash64": "0D51978EED95686A",
      "text": "原来吉雉鸡真的\\n能在空中飞！\\r\\n它咻～地飞过了鬼山！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_npc_key_02",
      "hash64": "0D51968EED9566B7",
      "text": "宝伴够赞狗！\\n紫色的围巾好漂亮！\\r\\n我看到它在荒地散步！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_npc_key_03",
      "hash64": "0D51958EED956504",
      "text": "我以为有人倒在那里，\\n没想到是愿增猿在午睡！\\c\\n在池塘周围睡觉\\n的确很舒服啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_system_02",
      "hash64": "12B9CEF5C1892D17",
      "text": "收集到了\\n第１个宝伴的消息！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_system_03",
      "hash64": "12B9CDF5C1892B64",
      "text": "收集到了\\n第２个宝伴的消息！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_system_01",
      "hash64": "12B9CFF5C1892ECA",
      "text": "宝伴们的消息\\n都收集齐了！\\r\\n和丹瑜他们会合吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0380_sister_01",
      "hash64": "3CE52BD6CB165B21",
      "text": "我们要一个不落地收集\\n宝伴的目击消息！\\r\\n收集完了来会合哦！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
